               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : ">>> Add Zip::Writer – (with compress/decompress methods) – John’s request.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "       >>>> AUND FIX DOCS – SO FOR Compression::Reader – so clear it can either compress/decomrepss blobs OR create input streams from input streams – that do compression or decompression. (BLOB version just does directly but stream version compress compresses nothing).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "So john - back home for an hour.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "(11:26:27 AM) ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "attrs" : {
                              "href" : "mailto:lewispringle@gmail.com"
                           },
                           "type" : "link"
                        },
                        {
                           "type" : "strong"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "lewispringle@gmail.com",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "type" : "strong"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "/8E1204E6: ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "I've reviewed the DataExchange::Compression::Reader API.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "(11:26:45 AM) ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "attrs" : {
                              "href" : "mailto:lewispringle@gmail.com"
                           },
                           "type" : "link"
                        },
                        {
                           "type" : "strong"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "lewispringle@gmail.com",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "type" : "strong"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "/8E1204E6: ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "Is it clear / sensible to you?",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "(11:27:20 AM) ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "attrs" : {
                              "href" : "mailto:lewispringle@gmail.com"
                           },
                           "type" : "link"
                        },
                        {
                           "type" : "strong"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "lewispringle@gmail.com",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "type" : "strong"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "/8E1204E6: ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "What Reader::Compress does for a BLOB makes sense. But for a Stream, it creates an input stream from an input stream that compresses on teh fly.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "(11:27:53 AM) ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "attrs" : {
                              "href" : "mailto:lewispringle@gmail.com"
                           },
                           "type" : "link"
                        },
                        {
                           "type" : "strong"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "lewispringle@gmail.com",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "type" : "strong"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "/8E1204E6: ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "I think this is a funky thing to call a reader. For one method - its like a reader, but for the other its like a reader factory.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "(11:28:35 AM) ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "attrs" : {
                              "href" : "mailto:lewispringle@gmail.com"
                           },
                           "type" : "link"
                        },
                        {
                           "type" : "strong"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "lewispringle@gmail.com",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "type" : "strong"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "/8E1204E6: ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "Instead of adding a Writer class, I may just add an overload for Compress and Decompress that takes an OutputStream as well. And then rename \"Reader\" to - not sure what.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : " ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "type" : "strong"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : ": ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "Adapter would make perfect sense",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "(11:30:18 AM) ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
